{"id":"fa_cil","lemma":"fácil","pos":"adj","rank":346,"glosses":["easy, facile, simple (requiring little effort)","easy-to-use, user-friendly (clipping of fácil de usar)","easy (being readily available for sex)"],"ipa":"/ˈfaθil/","forms":{"femininePlural":"fáciles"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-f%C3%A1cil.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esto es tan fácil.","en":"This is so easy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501440"},{"text":"Empecemos con las preguntas fáciles.","en":"Let's start with the easy questions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645692"},{"text":"Es fácil de hacer.","en":"It's easily done.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442784"},{"text":"Empecemos por las preguntas fáciles.","en":"Let's start with the easy questions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645693"},{"text":"El libro es fácil.","en":"The book is easy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444126"}]}